silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_03_bridge_to_14_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_1_N#domesticcatbox silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCatBox is the typed-noun box whose Yoneda profile is the question set. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'N', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
